  "prefLabel": "Pol 206.24 Agency Staff",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pol 206.24 Agency Staff. Agency staff who have been designated by the council or director to request a hearing and present the council's case shall fully participate in the hearing. Other agency staff shall have no role in the hearing unless called as a witness.\n\nSource. #9223-A, eff 8-1-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pol100-800.html"
